    @startuml C2_Create_Vessel_Visit_Execution_Process_View
    title C2 – Create Vessel Visit Execution (Process View)

    actor "Logistics Operator" as LogisticsOp
    participant "Frontend\n(Angular)" as Frontend
    participant "OEM API\n(NestJS)" as API
    participant "IAM" as IAM
    database "Database" as DB

    LogisticsOp -> Frontend : Login
    Frontend -> IAM : OAuth 2.0 request
    IAM --> Frontend : JWT Token

    LogisticsOp -> Frontend : Submit VVN + arrival time
    Frontend -> API : POST /oem/vessel-visit-executions
    API -> IAM : Validate Bearer Token
    IAM --> API : Valid
    API -> DB : Check VVN, create VVE
    DB --> API : OK
    API --> Frontend : HTTP 201 Created
    Frontend --> LogisticsOp : VVE created successfully

    @enduml


    API -> DB : Valida VVN existente
    DB --> API : VVN encontrado (OK)

    API -> API : Gera identificador VVE\nRegistra arrival time\nAssigna creator user ID\nMarca como "In Progress"

    API -> DB : INSERT INTO VesselVisitExecutions (...)
    DB --> API : Confirma inserção (OK)


    API --> Frontend : HTTP 201 Created + VVEDTO (status: In Progress)
    Frontend --> LogisticsOp : Mostra confirmação e novo VVE

    @enduml
